  "description": "Han-Se began streaming as an adult broadcaster to rebel against a life that forced him to follow a predetermined path. Every night, he becomes “BJ Rabbit Peach,” receiving both insults and generous donations from anonymous viewers. To celebrate his first anniversary on the platform, Han-Se puts his first night up for auction among viewers, and the auction closes in an instant at the astronomical price of 1 billion won. The person who won BJ Rabbit Peach’s first night was none other than a well-known loyal viewer, “Breathing Werewolf.” Seeing him, who looked exactly like the alpha from his imagination, Han-Se couldn’t control his trembling heart. Avoiding the viewers watching the first-anniversary broadcast, he quietly whispered to him, “...Actually, this is my first time having sex.” Will BJ Rabbit Peach’s 1st-anniversary broadcast actually go off without a hitch?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
